; Mazab's thrown bomb -- the steel-blue clod he hurls (sampled from the object in his
; attack_projectile sheet). Mazab's "projectile" scene in EmittersEnemies (vfx/config/emitters_enemies.gd);
; LobProjectile instances it as the flying object's look and spins it as it tumbles.
; A soft glowing Core (the rock body) plus a short dust trail (local_coords=false, so it
; streaks behind the arc). No hitbox -- a lob only hurts on its explosion (mazab_explosion).

